Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you track him, Melone? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a decent blood sample now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,From Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When is this piece of\Njunk gonna get moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, please forgive us for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A replacement driver's on\Nhis way this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more of this noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't the parents do something\Nabout that wailing teat ruiner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Boarding with these\Nriffraff was such a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, miss, are you in decent shape or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sitting in my private cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes and read what's\Nwritten on the damn door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything with you that\Nhas your date of birth written on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were born on\NMarch 10th, 1977. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,24 this is molto bellissimo\Nexcellent vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick your grubby mitts off\Nmy property and get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice the force put into that\Nrather zesty slap confirms my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in perfect condition.\NJust what I need. Just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sublime and judging from\Nyour delicious digits, your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,blood type is oh right i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,don't need your name and i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,don't give a single shit\Nabout your pedigree either
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,what's absolutely crucial\Nis your health condition
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,date of birth and knowing\Nyour blood type a pisces
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,in type o bucciarati is\Nan aries in type a which
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,means the two of you are\Nutterly incompatible this is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,perfection it's divine even\Nyou're clearly a fan of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,cigs and booze do you do any\Ndrugs what about narcotics
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if you tell me you do then\Nthere's nothing more to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Say here than hey, lady,\Ncould you shut your knob and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,listen how you answer the\Nnext question will determine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,our success this is a question\Nof personal preference
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,which one would you\Nfancy you've heard of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient Indian Sanskrit\Ntext known as the Kama Star,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It includes more than 48 erotic positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One cannot underestimate their importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the crucial first step\Nin creating a stellar child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby head! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to be a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A bloodthirsty star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,De Mordo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight with our enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Criminy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all the doom and gloom\Nweighing everyone down all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Bucciarati say something he shouldn't\Nhave to Trish to make her angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's in this funk because\NBucciarati is actually staying quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish is being forced to come\Nto terms with her innate powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's her enigmatic father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, she has a lot on her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati has his hands tied when it comes\Nto bringing up anything of that nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I have to find a way\Nto learn more about her powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they'll shine a light\Non the boss's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's held tough through all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What strength of will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two and number three\Nare being total food hoarders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to tell them to\Nshare their hamburger with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a scrap of food\Nto speak of in here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you two get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where the heck could\Nmy burger have run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that poking out\Nfrom under the seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this on its back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you were supposed to watch\Nthe ceiling, so what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I should have been on watch,\Nbut I was dealing with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From all that racket outside,\Nmy guess is the truck stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he might have tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that guy was a damn nutcase!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that twisted\Ndegenerate playing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks he can scare me and\Nlive to tell the freaking tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever see that pervert\Nagain, I'll murder him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the conductor of this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop everything and come to my cabin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've got a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother dearest is teaching it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby heads first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Little
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one. Fantastico.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already responding to\NMama's violent inclinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Mother knows best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was assaulted by some creepy pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He just waltzed in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Which
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,means your shitty cabins\Ncould use some better locks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the weld he gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I could scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking that guy down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do those words mean? Damn that prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now please pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mr. Lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the king of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here is Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant, along with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And the striped one is Mr. Zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what the word\Nmurder means. Makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It means to kill or to\Nput an end to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, these are some things the kids do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,playing with tops, baseball,\Nbowling, and ice skating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all the fun things you\Ncan do with those activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These boys here are pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's one, they're a piece of shit,\Nbut two or more are called pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're getting this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,know that the way in which you kill\Nthem is totally up to your discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, no harm is to\Nbefall this girl named Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's to be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, there's a new guy with\Nthem that we don't have data on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be with Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you seek them\Nboth out and end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take your damn piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking leaks is what babies do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm losing it, the lock\Ndoesn't seem to have been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this wet stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this train, now weird\Nshit's leaking from the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But ma 'am, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Gross! It reeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting! Signora?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that being so, what\Nwould you say about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Di molto! Fantabulous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good little student!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still much left for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I say not yet?\NYou'll have to wait. I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,can't take this anymore\NI won't spend another
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,second on this damn train\Nbut you can bet I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,sue the train company and\Nhold them accountable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have a concussion for all I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bizarre. Why can't I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Her parenting was too good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great that she taught the little psycho\Nin training the importance of killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but she did it too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.36,0:10:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I admit you're a talented bambino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Bucciarati's DNA sample, the\Nautomatic tracking is well underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta put in the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but Baby Head's offspring is the\Npinnacle of long-range stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, all will perish before your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just steal one\Nalready. Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why don't we just\Nannounce ourselves to the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll ambush us and that'll be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this, but\NFugo's got a real good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's hear what\NBucciarati wants us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Driving off with one of\Nthese would be too obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if we were to\Ntake a hundred of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think happens\Nwhen multiple cars vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But the cars have been dismantled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and the parts are scattered\Nall over the city and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tracking down the stolen cars\Ngets a lot more complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,which gives us plenty of\Ntime to get to Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it definitely beats us hitchhiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, I'll leave it to\Nyou to tell Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go get a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get down from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:11:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I have a question\Nfor you. It's kind of dumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but even so, I hope you'll be willing\Nto answer it What's the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't there a bathroom\Nin this stuffy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And please don't say you're\Nexpecting me to wear a diaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not, but\Nyou do make a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, I knew\Nyou were reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This closet will be our bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Have at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you needed to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know where this portal\Nleads, but I'm sure the turtle will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It might actually be good for him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're\Nnot suggesting that I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, we'll be traveling by car now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the area's secured, we can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that bike come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And where'd the driver go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Syria!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a long-range stand on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But its power isn't being\Nkept in check by a user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, be extra careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A bike just appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They vanished! Bucciarati!\NWhere's Trish? Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had the turtle the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I wouldn't\Nhave seen them exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could something have stolen\Nthem right from under my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get to work, Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Di molto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Di molto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravissimo, Babyhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make yourself scarce\Ntill you can slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mystery man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, then that must be the new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if he finds you, you'll have\Nno choice but to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, but you must move in\Nsilence lest the others find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Holding on to Trish is a must,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but just to be safe, I'll\Nhave them head over as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I sensed a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something trying to attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something removed my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you hurry it up? Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's just waving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Bucciarati just wants us to hurry\Nup with the car so we can hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you all take a chill pill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The motor, that's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The cabinet's gone and still no stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And why am I not able to\Nsee it when it attacks me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How's he hiding it,\Ndislodging pieces of my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You got his leg and eye too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolto, wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now back to Poppa, baby head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not following what you're getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Living organism?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules of the living and the\Ndead don't apply to stands like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, it was the cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking at my attacker the\Nentire time, but didn't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He attacks by disassembling the human body
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and rearranging the pieces\Ninto something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, at this point, what\Ndifference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That rookie hasn't been breathing for\Na while now, and he's missing a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get rid of him and grab the\Nturtle so Trish remains your captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It splits itself apart\Nto dodge, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to... tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, that was just your standard rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it's gonna\Nget away with Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And once it does, it'll\Nprobably kill Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a freakish amount of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really beat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this neophyte's body here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's gone totally\Naccording to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl is mine and no one is the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Di molto! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be seeing you soon, Melone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Rearranging the human\Nbody into other objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,your powers just sparked a terrific idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:19:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,your abilities aren't all that\Ndissimilar from my golden wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have the power to create something\Nentirely new. You've taught me a lot and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,your tenacious spirit pushed me to the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,absolute brink to put\Nit like this i'd say you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,pushed me to be better\Nmelone are you still
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,on the line it completely slipped my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but i just now figured\Nout how the new guy's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,power works what's this about the new guy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Baby head?\NWhy do you care about the dead newbie? His
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,eye he's putting it back in the socket he\Ndid the same thing with this throat and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,leg he has the power to make living things\Nhe made new body parts his powers are
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the opposite of mine what who the hell are\Nyou rambling on about no you don't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the newbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:19:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's coming after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me, Melone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He transformed part of the bike into\Nsome kind of weird roots! I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get rid of the\Nparts that are stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get off this bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it turn into rocks again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after the turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll stop him dead in his tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just simmer down, baby head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him pick it up if he wants. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because after the fool goes for the turtle,\Nyou'll eviscerate the little upstart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bike's spewing oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure he can never revive again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you credit, you actually\Nmanaged to spook me a bit, bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready for the hurt. Cause\NI'm gonna rip your head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a talent for transforming\Nbody parts into objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's inspired something in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was simply fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps it was our similar abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that ultimately drew the\Ntwo of us to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, thanks to your influence,\NGolden Wind is a lot more capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where the hell did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I tore off your freaking\Nwrist, so how'd it just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tore it off, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I chose to let it go on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do you a solid and\Ngive you some free advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hand would be much better\Nserved keeping yourself from harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than foolishly going after me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shove that advice up\Nyour smug ass! Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The hand you just severed has\Nalready become a different
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,organism and is eagerly devouring\Nyou from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:21:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed it, it's now a piranha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:23:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do to show how
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,much I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I must not sell you what. Must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to show how much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna freak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
